https://github.com/harbor-framework/harbor

Harbor is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Pier contains modifications to the original Harbor code.

Synergy's benchmark/src/synergy_bench/trial.py adapts the separate-verifier
lifecycle from datacurve-pier 0.3.1 (https://pypi.org/project/datacurve-pier/0.3.1/).
Modifications separate cleanup from verifier deadlines, preserve committed
rewards, bound cleanup, and disable automatic verifier timeout retries.
The dependency version is pinned in benchmark/pyproject.toml and uv.lock.
